This package is an AEAP Composition Boundary Adapter — a thin wrapper
that attaches the AEAP Runtime Decision Point (via aiyoplane-mcp-authz)
to the OpenAI Agents SDK function-tool invocation surface.

Specification: https://github.com/aiyoplane/aeap
Trust surface: https://aiyoplane.com/trust

